OL,3,GNEWSAMPs call on city Greens to disown
OL,4,AZionism motion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree Birmingham Labour MPs have called
OL,7,Ffor the city council's power-sharing
OL,8,Fcoalition to end if Green Party cabinet
OL,9,Fmembers do not disown a motion
OL,10,Fdeclaring Zionism a form of racism.
OL,12,FIn a letter to Liberal Democrat council
OL,13,Fleader Roger Harmer, MPs Al Carns, Jess
OL,14,FPhillips and Preet Gill urge the
OL,15,Fcouncillors to publicly denounce the
OL,16,Fpolicy adopted at the Green's
OL,17,Fconference earlier this month.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
