OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAMPs call on city Greens to disown
OL,4,AZionism motion
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarmer told the BBC the Lib Dems would
OL,7,Fcontinue working in coalition with the
OL,8,FGreens, as long they continue to abide
OL,9,Fby a partnership agreement which
OL,10,Fincludes a commitment to fight
OL,11,Fantisemitism.
OL,13,FBirmingham Greens referred the BBC to a
OL,14,Fstatement saying its councillors "stand
OL,15,Fagainst rising antisemitism".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
